    ccs notify on                      Notify on task end + questions (needs jq)
    ccs notify on iterm2               Pin the terminal instead of auto-detect

${C_BOLD}CONTEXT WINDOW${C_RESET}
    ccs sizes CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS from the model's real window, so
